{"product_id":"nasty-shisha-nic-salt-lemon-mint","title":"Nasty Shisha Nic Salt - Lemon Mint","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nics-salts-juices\" title=\"Nasty Juice\"\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/a\u003e Lemon Mint from the shisha series is a bright, sourish and minty combination of clean tasting lemons and peppermint. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe recommend this to those that like the raspberries that want to try a new shisha twist with the addition of sweet green grapes. The raspberries provide an excellent gummy pop to the texture of the clouds when inhaling. It's a fruity sensation like no other. Highly recommended.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhats Included:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml Nasty Shisha Salt Series \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs and Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50%PG \/ 50%VG, Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ML Bottle Size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574754549815,"sku":"Nasty - Lemon Mint 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574754582583,"sku":"Nasty - Lemon Mint 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-shisha-salt-lemon-mint.png?v=1743120651","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-shisha-nic-salt-lemon-mint","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




